  "Used by player or free company names if all their retainers, airships or submersibles are away.": "當玩家或部隊的所有雇員、飛行船或潛水艇皆已派遣時，用於顯示玩家或部隊名稱。",
  "Used by player or free company names if some their retainers, airships or submersibles are away and some are available.": "當玩家或部隊的雇員、飛行船或潛水艇部分已派遣、部分可用時，用於顯示玩家或部隊名稱。",
  "Used by player or free company names if all their retainers, airships or submersibles are available.": "當玩家或部隊的所有雇員、飛行船或潛水艇皆可用時，用於顯示玩家或部隊名稱。",
  "Used by the Retainers and Machines headers if all retainers, airships or submersibles are away.": "當所有雇員、飛行船或潛水艇皆已派遣時，用於雇員與載具標題列。",
  "Used by the Retainers and Machines headers if some retainers, airships or submersibles are away and some are available.": "當雇員、飛行船或潛水艇部分已派遣、部分可用時，用於雇員與載具標題列。",
  "Used by the Retainers and Machines headers if all retainers, airships or submersibles are available.": "當所有雇員、飛行船或潛水艇皆可用時，用於雇員與載具標題列。",
  "Used by single crops if they are withered.\nUsed by plot or player names if any of their crops is withered.": "用於已枯萎的單一作物。\n若地塊或玩家的任一作物已枯萎，也用於顯示地塊或玩家名稱。",
  "Used by single crops if they are wilted.\nUsed by plot or player names if any of their crops are wilted and none are withered.": "用於已凋萎的單一作物。\n若地塊或玩家的作物有凋萎且無枯萎，也用於顯示地塊或玩家名稱。",
  "Used by single crops if they are grown out.\nUsed by plot or player names if any of their crops are grown out and none are wilted or withered": "用於已成熟過度的單一作物。\n若地塊或玩家的作物有成熟過度且無凋萎或枯萎，也用於顯示地塊或玩家名稱。",
  "Used by single crops if they are growing regularly.\nUsed by plot or player names if all of their crops are growing regularly.": "用於正常生長中的單一作物。\n若地塊或玩家的所有作物皆正常生長中，也用於顯示地塊或玩家名稱。",
  "Used by single crops if they are growing regularly and require no tending anymore.\nUsed by plot or player names if all of their crops are growing regularly and require no tending anymore.": "用於正常生長且不再需要照料的單一作物。\n若地塊或玩家的所有作物皆正常生長且不再需要照料，也用於顯示地塊或玩家名稱。",
  "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if any crop is withered.": "若有任一作物已枯萎，用於作物標題與折疊標題。",
  "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if any crop is wilted and none is withered.": "若有作物凋萎且無枯萎，用於作物標題與折疊標題。",
  "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if any crop is grown out and none is wilted or withered.": "若有作物成熟過度且無凋萎或枯萎，用於作物標題與折疊標題。",
  "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if all crops are growing regularly.": "若所有作物皆正常生長中，用於作物標題與折疊標題。",
  "Used by the Crops header and the collapsed header if all crops are growing regularly and require no tending anymore.": "若所有作物皆正常生長且不再需要照料，用於作物標題與折疊標題。",
  "Used by the collapsed header to give it a border to improve visibility.": "用於折疊標題的邊框，以提升可視性。",
  "Used by all text that is not colored differently.": "用於所有未另行上色的文字。",
  "Used by all headers that are not colored differently.": "用於所有未另行上色的標題。",
  "Used by disabled retainers or machines.": "用於已停用的雇員或載具。",
  "Used for the background color.": "用於背景顏色。",

