  "Outdoor crops only refresh every 63 minutes on a ward-specific update timer.\nAny timer may be delayed by up to 63 minutes.\nFertilizing a plant during these delays will automatically trigger updates.\nThey will still grow out/wilt/wither in order, and grown-out plants do not wither anymore.\nIndoors, clearing the house and re-entering should automatically trigger updates.\nYou can disable this tooltip in the configuration.":
    "室外作物只會依照每區專屬的更新計時器每 63 分鐘刷新一次。\n任何計時器都可能延遲最多 63 分鐘。\n在這段延遲期間施肥會自動觸發更新。\n作物仍會依序成熟過度/凋萎/枯萎，且已成熟過度的作物不會再枯萎。\n室內的話，清空房屋再重新進入應該會自動觸發更新。\n你可以在設定中停用此提示。",
